From cd6af724f7951020fa4687e212282187a275ec50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sardi-dev <134648583+sardi-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:21:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/25] Add the Deepwind Gorge battleground

The battleground had a template row but no class, so the map could not be
played. Three mines are captured at their banners and give points over
time, and each team has a gold cart that the other team can take from its
base and bring to its own cart spot. The team that loses the cart loses
up to 200 points, which go to the capturer. The first team to 1600 wins.

Adds the queue type, the scoreboard columns, the cart game object type
(36), the click on a dropped cart, the spell click filter by team and the
linked summon of aura 428 that makes the cart follow its carrier. The
state of a cart is sent to the team carrying it, as the client interface
shows it. The achievements of the map are left out, their criteria types
are not implemented.

Based on Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8.
